--- 6. статус:
{"connected": true, "status": "connected", "scope": null, "athlete": {"id": "i98765", "name": "T. Rivera"}}

--- 7. wellness через прокси:
[{"date": "2026-11-07", "resting_hr": 52}]
 [200]
--- 8. reproduce старого бага: дублирующий scope должен отклоняться (проверка стаба):
{"error": "invalid_request", "error_description": "Duplicate scope"}
 [400]
--- 9. connect для u_rivera (нормальный flow):
callback: 302
{"connected": true, "status": "connected", "scope": null, "athlete": {"id": "i98765", "name": "T. Rivera"}}

--- 10. guard: тот же юзер приходит с ДРУГИМ athlete id -> 409, связь не меняется:
{"error": "intervals account differs from the linked one"}
 [409]
{"connected": true, "status": "connected", "scope": null, "athlete": {"id": "i98765", "name": "T. Rivera"}}

--- 11. подделанный state -> 400:
{"error": "bad state or code"}
 [400]
--- 12. отзыв токена на стороне Intervals (стаб 401) -> статус revoked, reconnect:
{"error": "intervals returned 401"}
 [401]
{"connected": false, "status": "revoked, reconnect"}

